Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.50,Opening,,0,0,0,,我突然听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:02.79,Opening,,0,0,0,,实习生的心声
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:04.40,Opening,,0,0,0,,她说：
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.79,0:00:04.40,Special,,0,0,0,,我还有7秒就会死
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:06.50,Inner,,0,0,0,,【心声】六……五……四……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.50,Inner,,0,0,0,,【心声】三……二……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.50,Inner,,0,0,0,,【心声】他怎么没死？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:17.50,Inner,,0,0,0,,前七次明明都死在这里……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,顾总，您的您的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:22.00,Inner,,0,0,0,,【心声】别喝啊！里面有花生酱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:22.00,Inner,,0,0,0,,你不是严重过敏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,林小雨。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,顾……顾总？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,实习生啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.00,InnerSpecial,,0,0,0,,【心声】第八次循环
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:27.00,InnerSpecial,,0,0,0,,他第一次活到了09:17
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.50,Inner,,0,0,0,,【心声】第八次循环……又开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:32.50,Inner,,0,0,0,,【心声】但是这一次……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.50,InnerSpecial,,0,0,0,,要死的人，好像是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.00,Ending,,0,0,0,,下一次死亡倒计时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:35.00,Special,,0,0,0,,09:23
